        "content": "## Website Answer Widget: lead capture\nWhen the chat widget cannot answer, it offers a short form (name, phone). This webhook checks the fields and adds a row to the **Leads** tab of a dummy-data sheet, so the front desk can call back in the morning.\n\nAnswers come from **Portfolio demo · Practice Knowledge Assistant**. Demo only, dummy data, inactive.",
